  "content_id": "16136219",
  "title": "Hedera HBAR Network Fees",
  "description": "Hedera (HBAR) Network – Enterprise-Grade Efficiency\nHedera is a fast, energy-efficient network for both crypto and real-world applications...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ4RQN8VK2F5WN04G68TRQC\">Hedera (HBAR) Network – Enterprise-Grade Efficiency</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Hedera is a fast, energy-efficient network for both crypto and real-world applications.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4RQN8QV0NEF4WR6M4KFPT\">How HBAR Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Flat fee model</b> based on transaction type</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Paid in <b>HBAR</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge handles the fee automatically without requiring user customization.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4RQN8236TMQEVK5RR5Z8T\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Flat, predictable fee</b>.</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4RQN8DKE6G4WQ8XBQA2RF\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Generally around <b>$0.001 to $0.003 USD</b>.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4RQN82APENGRGEWFSVV12\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">HBAR is ultra-fast with flat low fees—ideal for microtransactions, NFT transfers, and enterprise needs. Edge Wallet makes sending HBAR simple and cheap.</p>",
